# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════
# Public Repository - Minimal Code Display
# Goal: Show only the core Go source code for transparency and trust
# ═══════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════════

# ───── Build Artifacts & Binaries ──────────────────────────────────────────
# Compiled binaries - users should build from source
*.exe
*.dll
*.so
*.dylib
*.test
*.out
dist/

# Windows resource files (generated)
*.syso

# ───── Build & Helper Scripts ──────────────────────────────────────────────
# Batch files for building and setup
*.bat

# Node.js helper scripts (icon conversion, etc.)
*.js
node_modules/
package.json
package-lock.json

# Installer configuration
*.iss
installer-output/
innosetup-installer.exe
INSTALLER-README.md

# ───── Assets & Resources ──────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Icons, images, and Windows resources
assets/
winres/

# ───── Development Files ───────────────────────────────────────────────────
# IDE / editor settings
.idea/
.vscode/
*.swp
.*.swp
*~

# OS artefacts
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db

# Logs & temp files
*.log
*.tmp
*.bak
nul

# Go coverage profiles
*.cover
*.cov
coverage/

# Code-signing artifacts — attestation certs, public keys, issued certs.
# These are regenerable (attestation chain) or specific to a given YubiKey
# (issued cert). Never commit.
scripts/sign/out/

# PowerShell drops its module-analysis cache under $LOCALAPPDATA; a test that
# actually spawns powershell.exe with a stripped environment can resolve that
# relative to the repo root. Regenerable, never ours to commit.
Microsoft/

# ───── Documentation to Keep ───────────────────────────────────────────────
# Core files that WILL be checked in:
# - *.go (all Go source code)
# - go.mod, go.sum (dependency management)
# - README.md, *.md (documentation)
# - .github/ (CI/CD workflows)
# - LICENSE (if present)
